{"answer":null,"concept_id":"nsys-timeline-vs-ncu-kernel","content_sha256":"sha256:56973163342fd165ac7b3c9754abf82d06010c84ca370388ea7508613eed7049","correct_option_ids":["a"],"created_at":1789352442.7033029,"domain":"operator-development","explanation":"已有 launch-gap 概述。这里明确 ncu/nsys 分工，形成剖析链：先 nsys 定位间隙，再 ncu 进核。","id":"q-operator-ncu-vs-nsys-001","options":[{"id":"a","text":"Nsight Systems 看时间线：kernel 间隙、CPU launch、同步、拷贝、图 replay。ncu 解释核内；nsys 解释核间。LLM decode 常见病是间隙而不是 MMA 没打满"},{"id":"b","text":"继续在 ncu 里把 occupancy 调到 100%"},{"id":"c","text":"端到端慢只能换更大的 GPU"},{"id":"d","text":"nsys 不能看 GPU，只看 CPU 火焰图"}],"prompt":"端到端慢但单个 kernel 在 ncu 里已经很好。下一步该用哪类工具、看什么？","schema_version":"question/v1","skill":"diagnosis","source_refs":[{"kind":"official_docs","title":"NVIDIA Nsight Compute","url":"https://docs.nvidia.com/nsight-compute/NsightCompute/index.html"},{"kind":"official_docs","title":"NVIDIA CUDA C++ Programming Guide","url":"https://docs.nvidia.com/cuda/cuda-c-programming-guide/"}],"status":"enabled","topic":"profiling","type":"single_choice","wiki_refs":[]}
